#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:49
msgid "Pocket"
msgstr "Джобен"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:54
msgid ""
"Customer display for small screens: a docked running total, the newest item on top, full-screen payment states. For a phone on a stand."
msgstr ""
"Клиентски дисплей за малки екрани: закрепен текущ сбор, най-новият артикул отгоре и състоянията на плащане на цял екран. За телефон на поставка."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:70
msgid "Marquee"
msgstr "Рекламен екран"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:75
msgid ""
"Customer display for large screens: brand column with greeting and promo space, the just-added item as a hero, big totals. For a monitor or wide tablet."
msgstr ""
"Клиентски дисплей за големи екрани: колона с марката, поздрав и място за промоции, последно добавеният артикул като акцент и големи суми. За монитор или широк таблет."

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:93
msgid ""
"The responsive default: itemised list with a totals panel on wide screens, a docked total on narrow ones. Install it to customise."
msgstr ""
"Адаптивният шаблон по подразбиране: списък с артикули и панел със суми на широки екрани, закрепена сума на тесни. Инсталирайте го, за да го персонализирате."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:106
msgid "Carousel"
msgstr "Въртележка"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:108
msgid ""
"Rotate your own pictures between sales. Swap the three image links for yours and edit the captions; a small version keeps cycling under the totals."
msgstr ""
"Показвайте свои снимки между продажбите. Заменете трите връзки към изображения с ваши и редактирайте надписите; малка версия продължава да се върти под сумите."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:122
msgid "Specials board"
msgstr "Табло със специални предложения"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:124
msgid ""
"A short list of featured items and prices for the idle screen, with an \"ask about today's specials\" line on the order screens. Edit the four lines."
msgstr ""
"Кратък списък с избрани артикули и цени за неактивния екран и ред „попитайте за днешните специални предложения“ на екраните за поръчка. Редактирайте четирите реда."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:138
msgid "Follow & review"
msgstr "Последвайте и оставете отзив"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:140
msgid ""
"Your social handle and a QR code between sales; paste in your own QR image. Adds your handle to the order screens."
msgstr ""
"Вашето име в социалните мрежи и QR код между продажбите; поставете свое QR изображение. Името ви ще се показва и на екраните за поръчка."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:154
msgid "Season's Greetings"
msgstr "Сезонни поздрави"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:156
msgid ""
"The Ledger with a festive idle screen for the December–January window; the theme carries a soft accent and a greeting line into the order screens. Edit the greeting to make it yours."
msgstr ""
"The Ledger с празничен неактивен екран за периода декември–януари; темата добавя дискретен акцент и поздрав към екраните за поръчка. Редактирайте поздрава, за да го персонализирате."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:170
msgid "Lunar New Year"
msgstr "Лунна нова година"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:172
msgid ""
"The Ledger with a red-and-gold idle screen wishing customers good fortune; the theme carries a soft accent and a greeting line into the order screens. Edit the greeting to make it yours."
msgstr ""
"The Ledger с червено-златен неактивен екран, който пожелава благополучие на клиентите; темата добавя дискретен акцент и поздрав към екраните за поръчка. Редактирайте поздрава, за да го персонализирате."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:186
msgid "Eid Mubarak"
msgstr "Честит Байрам"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:188
msgid ""
"The Ledger with a night-blue-and-gold idle screen for Ramadan and Eid al-Fitr; the theme carries a soft accent and a greeting line into the order screens. Edit the greeting to make it yours."
msgstr ""
"The Ledger с тъмносиньо-златен неактивен екран за Рамадан и Рамазан байрам; темата добавя дискретен акцент и поздрав към екраните за поръчка. Редактирайте поздрава, за да го персонализирате."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:202
msgid "Diwali"
msgstr "Дивали"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:204
msgid ""
"The Ledger with a warm idle screen of lights; the theme carries a soft accent and a greeting line into the order screens. Edit the greeting to make it yours."
msgstr ""
"The Ledger с топъл неактивен екран със светлини; темата добавя дискретен акцент и поздрав към екраните за поръчка. Редактирайте поздрава, за да го персонализирате."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:218
msgid "Valentine's Day"
msgstr "Денят на влюбените"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:220
msgid ""
"A love letter with a wax seal on a blush ground; the theme carries a soft accent and a greeting line into the order screens. Edit the greeting."
msgstr ""
"Любовно писмо с восъчен печат на розов фон; темата добавя дискретен акцент и поздрав към екраните за поръчка. Редактирайте поздрава."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:234
msgid "Mother's Day"
msgstr "Ден на майката"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:236
msgid ""
"A ring of petals around the greeting, with a soft accent on the order screens. Edit the greeting."
msgstr ""
"Венец от листенца около поздрава и дискретен акцент на екраните за поръчка. Редактирайте поздрава."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:250
msgid "Father's Day"
msgstr "Ден на бащата"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:252
msgid "A workshop card between plaid bands. Edit the greeting."
msgstr "Картичка от работилница между карирани ленти. Редактирайте поздрава."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:266
msgid "Easter"
msgstr "Великден"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:268
msgid "A row of patterned eggs on a spring gradient. Edit the greeting."
msgstr "Редица шарени яйца върху пролетен градиент. Редактирайте поздрава."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:282
msgid "Halloween"
msgstr "Хелоуин"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:284
msgid "An orange moon, bats and jagged grass. Edit the greeting."
msgstr "Оранжева луна, прилепи и назъбена трева. Редактирайте поздрава."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:298
msgid "Thanksgiving"
msgstr "Ден на благодарността"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:300
msgid "A harvest wreath of leaves. Edit the greeting."
msgstr "Есенен венец от листа. Редактирайте поздрава."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:314
msgid "Hanukkah"
msgstr "Ханука"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:316
msgid "A menorah of nine candles. Edit the greeting."
msgstr "Менора с девет свещи. Редактирайте поздрава."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:330
msgid "New Year"
msgstr "Нова година"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:332
msgid "Confetti and a gold burst. Edit the greeting."
msgstr "Конфети и златен фойерверк. Редактирайте поздрава."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:346
msgid "Nowruz"
msgstr "Навруз"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:348
msgid "Tulips for the spring equinox. Edit the greeting."
msgstr "Лалета за пролетното равноденствие. Редактирайте поздрава."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:362
msgid "Sale"
msgstr "Разпродажба"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:364
msgid ""
"The Ledger with a promotional idle screen: a headline and an offer line you edit for each promotion."
msgstr ""
"The Ledger с промоционален неактивен екран: заглавие и оферта, които редактирате за всяка промоция."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:378
msgid "Black Friday"
msgstr "Черен петък"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:380
msgid ""
"Blackout with a deals ticker, and the offer line repeated on the order screens. Edit the offer."
msgstr ""
"Blackout с лента с оферти и повторение на офертата на екраните за поръчка. Редактирайте офертата."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:394
msgid "Detailed Receipt"
msgstr "Подробна разписка"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:396
msgid ""
"Extended info with SKU, unit price, full tax breakdown, customer address, and cashier details."
msgstr ""
"Разширена информация със SKU, единична цена, пълен данъчен разбив, адрес на клиента и данни за касиера."

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:409
msgid ""
"Items listed without prices. Includes gift message from customer note and return reference."
msgstr ""
"Артикулите са изброени без цени. Включва подаръчното съобщение от бележката на клиента и референтен номер за връщане."

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:422
msgid ""
"Full-page A4/Letter invoice with bill-to/ship-to addresses, an itemised products table, and an optional \"How to pay\" panel (bank transfer + QR-encoded order-pay URL) shown when the order still needs payment."
msgstr ""
"Инвойс на цяла страница A4/Letter с адреси за фактуриране и доставка, таблица с артикули и незадължителен панел „Как да платите“, показван, когато поръчката все още трябва да бъде платена."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:433
msgid "Minimal / Modern"
msgstr "Минималистичен / Модерен"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:435
msgid ""
"Compact receipt with a centered store header, bold double-border order band and dense item rows. Same essentials as Standard, less vertical space."
msgstr ""
"Компактна разписка с центриран хедър на магазина, удебелена лента с двойна рамка за поръчката и плътни редове с артикули. Същите основни елементи като Standard, но с по-малка височина."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:446
msgid "Narrow Receipt"
msgstr "Тясна разписка"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:448
msgid ""
"Compact monospace receipt sized for narrow paper or HTML-capable thermal printers. Prints cleanly in black and white."
msgstr ""
"Компактна разписка с моноширинен шрифт, подходяща за тясна хартия или термопринтери с HTML поддръжка. Печат в черно и бяло без проблеми."

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:460
msgid ""
"Fulfillment companion with items and quantities only. No pricing. Shipping address prominent."
msgstr ""
"Компаньон за изпълнение с артикули и количества само. Без цени. Адресът за доставка е на преден план."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:471
msgid "Quote / Estimate"
msgstr "Оферта / Прогноза"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:473
msgid ""
"Pre-sale document with items and pricing. No payment section. Includes validity notice and terms."
msgstr ""
"Документ преди продажба с артикули и цени. Без секция за плащане. Включва известие за валидност и условия."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:484
msgid "Standard Receipt"
msgstr "Стандартна разписка"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:486
msgid ""
"Streamlined receipt with logo, store info, itemized lines, totals and payment — covers what most stores need without the kitchen sink."
msgstr ""
"Опростена разписка с лого, информация за магазина, редове с артикули, общи суми и плащане — покрива това, от което повечето магазини имат нужда, без излишни подробности."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery. The (RTL) suffix marks right-to-left layout.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:497
msgid "Standard Receipt (RTL)"
msgstr "Стандартна разписка (RTL)"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:499
msgid ""
"Right-to-left version of the Standard Receipt for Arabic, Hebrew, Persian and Urdu sites. Mirrors layout and uses an RTL-friendly font stack."
msgstr ""
"Версия с дясно-наляво подреждане на Стандартна разписка за сайтове на арабски, иврит, персийски и урду. Огледално разположение и шрифтов стек, подходящ за RTL."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:511
msgid "Detailed Thermal Receipt (58mm)"
msgstr "Подробна термохартиена разписка (58 мм)"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:513
msgid ""
"Kitchen-sink 58mm receipt: full customer + addresses, tax breakdown, refunds, payments, terms and order barcode."
msgstr ""
"58 мм разписка с всичко: пълни данни на клиента + адреси, данъчен разбив, възстановявания, плащания, условия и баркод на поръчката."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:524
msgid "Detailed Thermal Receipt (80mm)"
msgstr "Подробна термохартиена разписка (80 мм)"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:526
msgid ""
"Kitchen-sink 80mm receipt: full customer + addresses, tax breakdown, refunds, payments, terms and order barcode."
msgstr ""
"80 мм разписка с всичко: пълни данни на клиента + адреси, данъчен разбив, възстановявания, плащания, условия и баркод на поръчката."

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:539
msgid ""
"Order items only with large font, no pricing. Designed for kitchen display or prep stations."
msgstr ""
"Само артикули от поръчката с голям шрифт, без цени. Предназначено за кухненски дисплей или подготвителни станции."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:550
msgid "Simple Thermal Receipt (58mm)"
msgstr "Проста термохартиена разписка (58 мм)"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:552
msgid ""
"Clean, minimal thermal receipt for narrow 58mm paper. Same layout as 80mm, adjusted for 32-character width."
msgstr ""
